  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Development Plan (UNDP) Deepening Democracy Project (2025 &#x2013; 2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Support to Elections Project, implemented under the Deepening Democracy Project (DDP), is a UNDP-led initiative aimed at strengthening Zambia&#x2019;s electoral integrity and broader democratic governance framework. The project responds to a formal request from the Electoral Commission of Zambia (ECZ), with the support of the Government of the Republic of Zambia. The project contributes to credible, transparent, and inclusive electoral processes and strengthened democratic governance in Zambia.</narrative>
  </description>
